para:WeatherRainShower
    a para:ParaphraseConcept ;
    rdfs:label "weather_rain_shower" ;
    rdfs:comment "e.g. 'Showers are expected in Newcastle this afternoon.' vs 'Rain showers are expected in Newcastle this afternoon.'  Source: Met Office DataHub weather codes 9/10 and 13/14 ('Light/Heavy rain shower'); bare 'shower(s)' meaning rain shower is general UK forecast usage." .

para:phrase_rain_shower
